    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29720" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mŏrōsus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		mora, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>lingering, slow, slow in coming</i> (lato Lat.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cui morosum videtur quodcunque futurum est,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cassiod. in Psa. 34, 20</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">iter fieri morosum quod ad celeritatem est
					inventum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Var. 1, 29</span></i>
			.</div>
